	(text "R10 single screw switch: RAW_ACT directly feeds R134.2 and R132.1 behind Q120/Q121; no separate ARM terminal or PYRO1_BUS net. J121.2 IGN, J121.1 OUT."
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 9ac29cee-a930-5480-8e40-e6153d0063a3))
	(text "Power switch on last, off first; the pyro channel is live whenever the board is on. No firing before accelerometer and barometer launch detection; bench USB or e-match disconnected."
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid b582dff2-5e14-56cd-86b4-89f83422ccf8))
	(text "R10 uses default board clearance; accepted loss of R9 single-defect spacing margins does not waive functional reset, gate or divider safety."
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 84d49b35-a87d-5fca-9999-f2f86fcf1da9))
	(text "Ground bus/continuity checks refuse firing; in flight readings only log/annunciate and never veto a fire. Refresh 960-cycle IWDG immediately before PE4 rises; never refresh while fire is active. Normal physical current <=20 ms; fault physical current <=36 ms; complete SAFETY and refresh <=5 ms after current off. Bench required."
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid c7f3c433-f684-58f5-b970-0351ea26c2e7))
